Subject: [DISCUSS] AlterConfigPolicy behavior in 3.9.2
Message-Id: <1DCA28B8-2000-41DD-B411-3AC72A21A693@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 1 Dec 2025 22:17:57 +0800
To: dev@kafka.apache.org
