-------------------------------------

             Summary: Bug releasing acquired records when maintained on off=
set level
                 Key: KAFKA-19953
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-19953
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Bug
            Reporter: Abhinav Dixit
