When we have releaseAcquiredRecords call on SharePartition and the batch is=
 being maintained per offset, if we have non matching member id while relea=
sing acquired records, we should skip only that offset and continue with th=
e next offset in the batch, not skip all the offsets after seeing the probl=
ematic offset

