Hi Andrew,

Thanks for looking into this PR!

AS1: Agree, we could also use DESCRIBE_CLUSTER for broker,
I will change the implementation after this KIP is accepted,
but this change is implementation detail for old implementation and not
related to the new public api
so I do not update KIP.

