> to talk to controllers, but it uses METADATA to talk to brokers. Since
> both brokers and controllers support DESCRIBE_CLUSTER in recent
> releases, I wonder whether you could also use DESCRIBE_CLUSTER
> If available with brokers too. The advantage is that the error handling
> when using --bootstrap-server with a controller is much nicer.
