Mickael Maison resolved KAFKA-19938.
------------------------------------
    Fix Version/s: 4.3.0
       Resolution: Fixed

> KafkaClusterTestKit not formatting all log directories on combined noes
> -----------------------------------------------------------------------
>
>                 Key: KAFKA-19938
>                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-19938
>             Project: Kafka
>          Issue Type: Bug
>            Reporter: Mickael Maison
>            Assignee: Mickael Maison
>            Priority: Major
>             Fix For: 4.3.0
>
>
> If I create a cluster via KafkaClusterTestKit with combined nodes and mul=
tiple log directories, the log directories that does not host the metadata =
log are not formatted.
> For example:
> {code:java}
> KafkaClusterTestKit cluster =3D new KafkaClusterTestKit.Builder(
>             new TestKitNodes.Builder().
>                 setNumBrokerNodes(numBrokers).
>                 setNumDisksPerBroker(numDisks).
>                 setCombined(combined).
>                 setNumControllerNodes(numControllers).build()).build())
> cluster.format();
> {code}
> I get the following:
> {noformat}
> .
> =E2=94=9C=E2=94=80=E2=94=80 combined_0_0
> =E2=94=82=C2=A0=C2=A0 =E2=94=9C=E2=94=80=E2=94=80 __cluster_metadata-0
> =E2=94=82=C2=A0=C2=A0 =E2=94=82=C2=A0=C2=A0 =E2=94=9C=E2=94=80=E2=94=80 0=
0000000000000000000.index
> =E2=94=82=C2=A0=C2=A0 =E2=94=82=C2=A0=C2=A0 =E2=94=9C=E2=94=80=E2=94=80 0=
0000000000000000000.log
> =E2=94=82=C2=A0=C2=A0 =E2=94=82=C2=A0=C2=A0 =E2=94=9C=E2=94=80=E2=94=80 0=
0000000000000000000.timeindex
> =E2=94=82=C2=A0=C2=A0 =E2=94=82=C2=A0=C2=A0 =E2=94=9C=E2=94=80=E2=94=80 l=
eader-epoch-checkpoint
> =E2=94=82=C2=A0=C2=A0 =E2=94=82=C2=A0=C2=A0 =E2=94=9C=E2=94=80=E2=94=80 p=
artition.metadata
> =E2=94=82=C2=A0=C2=A0 =E2=94=82=C2=A0=C2=A0 =E2=94=94=E2=94=80=E2=94=80 q=
uorum-state
> =E2=94=82=C2=A0=C2=A0 =E2=94=9C=E2=94=80=E2=94=80 bootstrap.checkpoint
> =E2=94=82=C2=A0=C2=A0 =E2=94=94=E2=94=80=E2=94=80 meta.properties
> =E2=94=94=E2=94=80=E2=94=80 combined_0_1
> {noformat}
> we can see the combined_0_1 directory has not been formatted, we don't ha=
ve a meta.properties file.
> If I run
> {code:bash}
> bin/kafka-storage.sh format --standalone -t $KAFKA_CLUSTER_ID -c config/c=
ontroller.properties
> {code}
> With log.dirs=3D/tmp/kraft-controller-logs,/tmp/kraft-controller-logs in =
controller.properties, the 2 log directories are correctly formatted.
> {noformat}
> ./kraft-combined-logs
> =E2=94=9C=E2=94=80=E2=94=80 __cluster_metadata-0
> =E2=94=82=C2=A0=C2=A0 =E2=94=94=E2=94=80=E2=94=80 00000000000000000000-00=
00000000.checkpoint
> =E2=94=9C=E2=94=80=E2=94=80 bootstrap.checkpoint
> =E2=94=94=E2=94=80=E2=94=80 meta.properties
> ./kraft-combined-logs2
> =E2=94=9C=E2=94=80=E2=94=80 bootstrap.checkpoint
> =E2=94=94=E2=94=80=E2=94=80 meta.properties
> {noformat}



