Latest version of kafka-clients:4.1.1 has CVE related to 'commons-beanutils=
'. I see that parent package 'commons-validator' is already upgraded in cod=
e but I don't see any releases having this upgraded version on maven reposi=
tory. Kindly make the version available as soon as possible on maven as thi=
s CVE is under HIGH category.

Thanks.
Brundha S V


