Hi All,
as already discussed in the separate mailing list thread
[DISCUSS] AlterConfigPolicy behavior in 3.9.2
https://lists.apache.org/thread/bknho1vrvby1tpq634g744vqf4mr8coh

I would like to propose this minikip
KIP-1252: AlterConfigPolicy compatibility in legacy Zookeeper mode
(3.9.2 release)
https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=399279475

that aims to combine a fix to an old inconsistency without breaking
any backward compatibility.

Adding new config in minor releases is an exception,
as for ZK support the 3.9.x branch is the end of the line

Objections are welcome
but If no objections are raised, you might even cast a vote in this thread :-)

cheers,
Edo

