Hi all,

We want to start a discussion thread for KIP-1254: Kafka Consumer Support
for Remote Tiered Storage Fetch [1], which is a sub-kip of KIP-1248 [2].

Let's use the main KIP-1248 discussion thread [3] for all high-level
questions or topics related to the broker side, and reserve this thread for
topics specific to the consumer side.

Thanks,
Tom

[1] https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/x/PobMFw
[2] https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/x/KYTMFw
[3]
https://lists.apache.org/list?dev@kafka.apache.org:lte=1M:[DISCUSS]%20KIP-1248

