Thanks a ton(!) for all the efforts on this Harish. It's a mountain to 
be moved to make this happen, and I am very happy to see this going over 
the finish line.

Also call out to David Arthur, for his outstanding support!

The bug-bash we did was great, but it's the nature of web-pages to 
literally always have some errors. So I am totally in favor to just make 
the switch, and avoid chasing a moving target. For 4.1 and older 
releases, docs should be stable, and if we cut over now, we can just 
fix-forward anything for upcoming 4.2 release, so I think it's pretty 
good timing to do to now IMHO. The release will force us naturally to 
check docs, and find issue.


-Matthias

