> > > > over to markdown based AK website (KIP 1133). Fully functional site
> is live
> > > > on staging at https://kafka.staged.apache.org/.
> > > >
> > > > If the Vote Passes:
> > > >
> > > > - I will migrate the source documentation in the docs directory of
> the
> > > > apache/kafka repository to Markdown for versions *3.5 and newer.*
> > > > - Older versions (pre-3.5) will be left as-is (HTML) in the kafka
> repo to
> > > > avoid disruption.
> > > > - Update CI/CD deploy the markdown branch to the live production
> site.
> > > >
> > > > For reference:
