Gaurav Narula created KAFKA-19990:
-------------------------------------

             Summary: NPE on handling an AllocateProducerIdsResponse 
                 Key: KAFKA-19990
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-19990
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Bug
    Affects Versions: 4.1.1, 3.9.1
            Reporter: Gaurav Narula


{{RPCProducerIdManager}} attempts to invoke {{handleAllocateProducerIdsResponse}} without checks for {{authenticationException}} and {{versionMismatch}} which can cause NPE at {{response.data()}} since {{response}} might be {{null}}.



