This email starts the discussion thread for *KIP-1255: Remote Read Replicas
for Kafka Tiered Storage*. The proposal introduces a lightweight broker
role, *Remote Read Replica*, dedicated to serving historical reads directly
from remote storage.

We=E2=80=99d appreciate your initial thoughts and feedback on the proposal.

