Just a quick note, we have made the following changes in kafka-site

* Default branch is now "markdown" (PRs should target this branch)
* asf-site has been updated with the Hugo-built site
* Any new commits to "markdown" branch are automatically deployed to
asf-staging (https://kafka.staged.apache.org/)
* "Build and Deploy" workflow can be manually run to update the live
website (see screenshot)

[image: image.png]

We have not yet merged the markdown changes to the Kafka release branches,
though expect that to happen soon.

So, in other words, we are live!

-David A

