Sebb created KAFKA-20005:
----------------------------

             Summary: The CSP must not be overridden
                 Key: KAFKA-20005
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-20005
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Bug
          Components: website
            Reporter: Sebb


The Content-Security-Policy header must not be overridden.

There is now a standard way to add local exceptions to the CSP:

[https://infra.apache.org/tools/csp.html]

Please update the .htaccess file accordingly.

Note that any exceptions need prior agreement from Privacy and must be documented in the .htaccess file.

https://github.com/apache/kafka-site/blob/106357750f424c22370eebe2e1066534ffe34c36/.htaccess#L1



--
