Kamal Chandraprakash resolved KAFKA-19995.
------------------------------------------
    Fix Version/s: 4.3.0
       Resolution: Fixed

> Record copy lag metrics during failures
> ---------------------------------------
>
>                 Key: KAFKA-19995
>                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-19995
>             Project: Kafka
>          Issue Type: Task
>          Components: Tiered-Storage
>            Reporter: Nandini Singhal
>            Assignee: Nandini Singhal
>            Priority: Major
>             Fix For: 4.3.0
>
>
> When tiered storage segment copies are failing with
> any outer-level exception, the RemoteCopyLagBytes
> and RemoteCopyLagSegments metrics are not emitted. This makes it
> impossible to detect growing lag during copy failures.



